<title><![CDATA[1 year since my brain injury! It’s been the hardest year of my...]]></title>
<link>https://prank-arum.GIThub.io/Feeds/TikTok/susi.vidal/7705992239855701262.mp4</link>
<guid>https://tiktok.com/embed/7705992239855701262</guid>
<description>
<![CDATA[1 year since my brain injury! It’s been the hardest year of my life. It felt important to me to take some time to reflect. Maybe this is just important for me and my journey, but I felt inclined to share. I could talk about every topic mentioned for hours. Thanks for listening. Thanks for supporting me and reaching out. Having all of you in my corner has meant the world and kept me going.  Depression is scary, it’s real. I mean it by reaching out to someone if you’re dealing with it. Verbalizing it is the first step. And it sucks but it’s worth it! Fighting is choosing to live another day. we need to all be nicer to ourselves ❤️
